        {
          "code": "coverage_is_derived",
          "note": "coverage.json is regenerated by scripts/build-coverage.py from the slice frontmatter, the migrations, the compiled action-registry dump and v2.js, and --check refuses a dead action, a missing page row, an uncovered project or a missing evidence path. DESIGN-PUBLISH measures built with units #32, #33, #36, #37, #89, #97, #103 and #149, 0 open, and evidence docs/design/README.md and docs/design/studio.html; its own gap is stated rather than hidden: 'published by PR today; P4 makes it live from the tenant rows'."
